@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Casual Admin Assistant
|a_default|
start
:Commence reference check;
:Check applicants referees;
:Is referee report complete;
:v1: Is referee report complete ({Incomplete Referee Report, Complete Referee Report}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = "Incomplete Referee Report"])
:Received Incomplete Referee Report process ends;
stop
else ([v1 = "Complete Referee Report"])
:Send Complete Referee Report to archive applications;
:Evaluate and rank candidates;
:Process concludes;
stop
endif
